      { "title": "What this changes", "required": true },
      { "title": "How I verified it", "required": true },
      { "title": "Anything a reviewer should look at twice" },
      {
        "title": "Clean-room and changeset",
        "required": true,
        "hint": "Two lines, each a checked box or a sentence on why it does not apply:\n- [ ] A changeset is included if a published package changed (`pnpm changeset`).\n- [ ] Clean-room: no code was copied from HAPI or any AGPL/GPL source, and no code was\n      copied verbatim from emdash / Happy / Nimbalyst. Design inspiration only."
      },
      {
        "title": "Screenshots",
        "required": true,
        "hint": "For anything a person could see: one before-and-after pair per change, composed into\na single side-by-side image and attached with `gh pr edit <n> --attach`. If nothing\nvisible changed, or a pair cannot be captured, say so and why. Keep this section either\nway."
      }
    ]
  },
